\" stroke=\"#44657f\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" marker-end=\"url(#m-DR-poi-flow-2)\"/></g><defs><marker id=\"m-DR-poi-flow-3\" markerWidth=\"11\" markerHeight=\"11\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5.5\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,1 L9,5.5 L0,10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#44657f\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/></marker></defs><g class=\"business-edge\"><title>DR-poi-4 Navi 算路并添加点位 → 确认点位已添加；读取添加结果</title><polyline points=\"714,1174 714,1258\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"7\"/><polyline points=\"714,1174 714,1258\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#44657f\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" marker-end=\"url(#m-DR-poi-flow-3)\"/></g><defs><marker id=\"m-DR-poi-flow-4\" markerWidth=\"11\" markerHeight=\"11\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5.5\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,1 L9,5.5 L0,10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#44657f\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/></marker></defs><g class=\"business-edge\"><title>DR-poi-5 确认点位已添加 → 设置临停属性；成功后才设临停</title><polyline points=\"714,1458 714,1542\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"7\"/><polyline points=\"714,1458 714,1542\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#44657f\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" marker-end=\"url(#m-DR-poi-flow-4)\"/></g><defs><marker id=\"m-DR-poi-flow-5\" markerWidth=\"11\" markerHeight=\"11\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5.5\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,1 L9,5.5 L0,10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#28716f\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/></marker></defs><g class=\"business-edge\"><title>DR-poi-5 确认点位已添加 → 保留失败所在步骤；失败/无成功证据</title><polyline points=\"381,1338 30,1338 30,2758 372,2758\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"7\"/><polyline points=\"381,1338 30,1338 30,2758 372,2758\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#28716f\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" marker-end=\"url(#m-DR-poi-flow-5)\"/></g><defs><marker id=\"m-DR-poi-flow-6\" markerWidth=\"11\" markerHeight=\"11\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5.5\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,1 L9,5.5 L0,10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#44657f\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/></marker></defs><g class=\"business-edge\"><title>DR-poi-6 设置临停属性 → App 同步最新路线；属性设置成功</title><polyline points=\"714,1742 714,1